  "items": [
    {
      "type": "research",
      "title": "筛选tensor字段时保留整数样本索引",
      "source": "huggingface/lerobot",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-20T12:14:21Z",
      "url": "https://github.com/huggingface/lerobot/commit/9c23a7db15f9c6332824ac8524c3ad889f3a002a",
      "commitSha": "9c23a7db15f9c6332824ac8524c3ad889f3a002a",
      "signals": [
        "_select_value用value[indices]，避免字段dtype构造索引导致bool、uint8、bfloat16改变目标样本。",
        "已读bool index2、uint8 index256、bfloat16 index257和padding对齐回归；本轮仅运行原创同类夹具，未执行上游测试。"
      ],
      "decision": "已入11月25日条件动作图：低精度字段不能改变样本身份。"
    },
    {
      "type": "research",
      "title": "所有benchmark保留逐episode种子与结果",
      "source": "huggingface/lerobot",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-19T15:24:36Z",
      "url": "https://github.com/huggingface/lerobot/commit/c15b8159ecfeade583825498901b61a432f0eb01",
      "commitSha": "c15b8159ecfeade583825498901b61a432f0eb01",
      "signals": [
        "eval_one无条件返回per_episode，含seed/success/sum_reward/max_reward；环境有metrics时另附。",
        "已读无自定义metrics的toy回归；不表示LIBERO策略能力变化，也不把episode区间当训练重复实验区间。"
      ],
      "decision": "12月18–20日配对评测复查；与昨日metrics支持区分，本次扩展到没有自定义metrics的所有benchmark。"
    },
    {
      "type": "research",
      "title": "环境服务把信号退出延后到owner循环",
      "source": "huggingface/lerobot",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-19T16:21:56Z",
      "url": "https://github.com/huggingface/lerobot/commit/83883ae60a8e1682552b6853e4170c74d83a4525",
      "commitSha": "83883ae60a8e1682552b6853e4170c74d83a4525",
      "signals": [
        "SIGINT/SIGTERM处理器只置shutdown_requested，serve(should_stop)由owner退出，避免Event.wait持锁时重入stop死锁。",
        "已读POSIX两信号×普通/持锁四种回归，要求活跃session保留到shutdown、环境恰好关闭一次及handlers恢复；本轮未执行上游进程测试。"
      ],
      "decision": "12月20日回归与SO-101部署生命周期选读；软件退出修复不等于硬件急停验证。"
    },
    {
      "type": "research",
      "title": "自定义processor与tokenizer要求当前调用者授权",
      "source": "huggingface/lerobot",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-20T14:48:36Z",
      "url": "https://github.com/huggingface/lerobot/commit/039e05183f38b02d28c5f6ac9dbc7ef1680728cd",
      "commitSha": "039e05183f38b02d28c5f6ac9dbc7ef1680728cd",
      "signals": [
        "外部step导入前检查trust_remote_code，默认false，校验ProcessorStep子类；本地checkpoint和已导入模块也不能代替当前授权。",
        "policy/env/reward各scope独立；FAST等独立tokenizer支持repo@revision固定。已读pipeline与官方文档，未运行任意远端代码，也未执行完整85文件上游回归。"
      ],
      "decision": "12月3日reward classifier和毕业项目依赖清单复查；不计模型/Agent研究新增。"
    },
    {
      "type": "research",
      "title": "EnvHub环境改为从Spaces下载",
      "source": "huggingface/lerobot",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-20T14:17:19Z",
      "url": "https://github.com/huggingface/lerobot/commit/37025bd14c689e0c0723a3f463e2d54f91de65e2",
      "commitSha": "37025bd14c689e0c0723a3f463e2d54f91de65e2",
      "signals": [
        "_download_hub_file的snapshot_download明确repo_type=space，保留revision与文件路径；评测、模拟机器人、server共用环境集成。",
        "已读下载参数回归和环境文档；每send_action推进一次仿真，读观测/推理等待不推进。是环境分发接口变化，无新控制成功率。"
      ],
      "decision": "后续SO-101仿真固定Space SHA与控制约定，不能以Hub模型仓ID替代Space身份。"
    },
    {
      "type": "research",
      "title": "Newton接触容量增长时保留接触属性",
      "source": "isaac-sim/IsaacLab",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-20T09:35:38Z",
      "url": "https://github.com/isaac-sim/IsaacLab/commit/a733031688c84fdd6d4141d618a945754e6fe907",
      "commitSha": "a733031688c84fdd6d4141d618a945754e6fe907",
      "signals": [
        "_allocate_contacts超过自动容量时重建CollisionPipeline并用pipeline.contacts()，替代非确定模式裸Contacts；保留逐接触刚度/阻尼/摩擦、matching与报告。",
        "作者CUDA kitless水弹性box/ground、MJWarp use_mujoco_contacts=False、nconmax12000复现，报告64项pytest；本轮只读补丁，未GPU复测。不是StanfordVL更新，也不是新策略效果。"
      ],
      "decision": "12月20日物理回归：容量参数改变不能静默改变接触定律；不改历史课。"
    }
  ],
